aln
File,aln/NanoswarmMaterialPredictor.v1.aln
Type,QPU.Datashard
Purpose,Bind the nanoswarm-material-ml crate to MD data sources and the Organichain rohvalue ledger so that biocompatible nanoswarm materials can be predicted and indexed in CyberFS under RoH and immune activation corridors. Designed for https://github.com/mk-bluebird/Nano-Tree and mk-bluebird/Organichain.

