SECTION,NEURORIGHTS-AND-CORRIDORS
ROW,rights,roh_corridor,scalar,roh_corridor,string,nonnull,"RoH ≤ 0.30 globally; rohvalue_norm encoded so that values above 0.30 corridor are treated as high risk and not selected"
ROW,rights,immune_corridor,scalar,immune_corridor,string,nonnull,"Immune activation norm must remain below a threshold consistent with biocompatibility_rating ≥ 0.57; model selection must respect this bound"
ROW,rights,non_actuating_clause,rule,non_actuating_clause,string,nonnull,"NanoswarmMaterialPredictor.v1 and nanoswarm-material-ml are non-actuating: they only propose materials; actual deployment must go through separate Organichain governors and ALN corridors."
ROW,rights,forward_only_clause,rule,forward_only_clause,string,nonnull,"Material predictions must not encode any rollback or capability reduction; selected materials must increase or preserve biocompatibility and stability corridors."

